rentalot contacts create — Create a contact with canonical API fields

Create a contact with canonical v1 fields. Single creates require --name and at least one of --email or --phone.

Usage:
  rentalot contacts create [flags]

Flags:
      --channel-preference string  preferred messaging channel
      --email string  email address
  -h, --help  help for create
      --language string  ISO 639-1 language code
      --name string  contact name (required when creating)
      --notes string  contact notes (update only)
      --phone string  phone number
      --referral-source string  referral source
      --role string  role: prospect, tenant, landlord, property_manager, vendor, other
      --source string  contact acquisition source
      --status string  status: prospect, scheduled, applicant, renter, archived

Global Flags:
      --config string  config file (default "<CONFIG_FILE>")
      --json  output as JSON
      --no-color  disable colored output
      --timeout duration  HTTP request timeout, including response body (must be positive) (default 30s)

